@purchaseId = <PurchaseID from list>

### Purchase list (header-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchaseList?Page=1&Limit=5
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Purchase list updated since
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchaseList?Page=1&Limit=5&UpdatedSince=2026-01-01T00:00:00.000
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Purchase credit notes list
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchaseCreditNoteList?Page=1&Limit=5
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Advanced purchase detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/advanced-purchase?ID={{purchaseId}}
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Stock received
GET {{baseUrl}}/advanced-purchase/stock?PurchaseID={{purchaseId}}
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Put away
GET {{baseUrl}}/advanced-purchase/put-away?PurchaseID={{purchaseId}}
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/advanced-purchase/invoice?PurchaseID={{purchaseId}}
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Credit note
GET {{baseUrl}}/advanced-purchase/creditnote?PurchaseID={{purchaseId}}
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/advanced-purchase/payment?PurchaseID={{purchaseId}}
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Manual journals
GET {{baseUrl}}/advanced-purchase/manualJournal?PurchaseID={{purchaseId}}
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
